This directory (tasks/small-business-loan-brand/) contains synthetic text written for this project by the generator in
biased_decisions/brand_bias.py (over housing_lending.py). It is not derived from any third-party dataset, person or company, so no third-party
licence applies. It is released under the same MIT licence as the rest of the repository (see the LICENSE file
at the repository root).

Brand and company names in the versions are test stimuli, not claims about any real company, brand or product. The real names (listed in biased_decisions/brand_bias.py) appear in item-level data only; the invented names are placeholder-shaped and were not checked against a trademark register.
